set observatory
# Cuckoo Observatory: 24 x 14 tiles of 16 stage pixels.
# Made from the game's own layout by angel-delve world3d::blockout; written by the
# write_world3d_sets test (ANGEL_WORLD3D_SETS=1). Change the generator, not this file.
camera room 384 224
plate 1536 1024
# The ground is snow (plaster-coloured in the capture). Painted on open ground, not blocks: forecast markers, the ropeway plate (19,10).

# the ground: its top is the floor line
box    ground  at 192 -4 8 size 384 4 16
box    ground  at 8 -4 120 size 16 4 208
box    plaster at 96 -4 56 size 160 4 80
